WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.960
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:40.260
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.440
...crazy about you!

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:48.230
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:49.630
Well, for the time being,

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:52.260
I want to think about stuff
while I'm walking.

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:53.600
While walking?

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:57.270
Mm-hmm. They say it's easier
to work things out while walking.

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:59.830
So I thought I'd walk
as far as I can, and then see.

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:05.880
Well, I'm off.

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:08.550
Take care!

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:13.550
And l will work on myself. l'll make myself
strong enough to accept...

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:17.280
...whatever Okayasu's decision
may be, and l'll wait...

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:28.130
Welcome!

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:36.070
"'The Emotional Puzzle"'

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:46.390
Where the hell are you?!

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:46.730
You leave a note saying just that you're
going on a trip and then don't come home!

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:51.200
"'Gone on a trip. Kairi"'

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:51.730
Mom's worried about you!

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:57.030
Yeah, sorry. But I'm not gonna be back
for a while, so tell her that.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:27.030
This is a lot harder
than I expected it to be...

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:29.000
Outta my way!!

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.040
You okay?

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:39.380
I told you to get outta the way!

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:41.050
You little...

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:43.050
Geez, what a rube!

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:45.240
Why, you little punks!

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:52.520
The one who was working here before me
was Okayasu, right? Why did he quit?

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:57.400
The truth is, we're keeping
our distance right now.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:00.330
Okayasu had another girl
that he liked besides me,

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:02.670
but when he declared his love to her,
she turned him down.

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:06.670
So, he wants to do some thinking,
and he left on a trip.

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:10.680
He says that until he gets his feelings
in order, he can't be dating me.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:14.010
But if he wants to try again,
then on the last day of summer break,

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:17.350
we decided to go on a trip.
I gave him a ticket.

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:19.350
I wonder if Okayasu will show up...

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:21.350
Sae...

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:22.690
Will you knock it off!

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:25.230
I just said what really happened!

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:28.160
"'Roto Noodles"'

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.820
That was good.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:36.230
I just gulped that down, but boy,
the noodles here are really good!

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:44.380
That fellow there is making them.
He looks like he's really set in his ways.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.050
That'll be 500 yen.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.240
Okay.

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:51.870
M- my wallet is gone!

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:57.390
T- those punks!

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:59.920
Oh, no... What am I gonna do?

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:18.340
Poor thing, having his change purse
stolen while he's traveling...

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:22.020
It's his fault for being careless.
No reason to let him eat without paying.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:26.690
You came out with that knife
and scared him half to death!

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:29.360
No, I'm the one who should be apologizing!

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:31.320
Thank you!

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:34.360
You worked very hard.

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:35.700
Uh... thank you...

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:39.700
What are you going to do now?
Are you going home?

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:44.040
No, I can't go home yet. I still
don't have things figured out yet.

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.100
Are you troubled by something?

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:50.710
There's a girl I'm keeping
my distance from right now.

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:55.380
Before I started dating her,
I had a girl I was in love with.

00:05:55.380 --> 00:06:00.320
There's no hope for that relationship,
so all I can do is give up on it,

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:04.660
but I can't just act like it was nothing,
and start seeing this girl.

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:07.990
And how do you feel about this girl?

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:10.000
I'm crazy about her.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:14.000
If Misao-chan- If the girl who
turned me down hadn't been in the picture,

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.670
I'm pretty sure she'd
be the love of my life.

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:20.670
It's late. Why don't
you stay here tonight?

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:26.010
And how about working here for a while?
You're going to need money for traveling.

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:27.950
Yeah! Could I?

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:31.980
"'No new messages"'

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:37.690
Momo-chan!

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:39.360
What about summer school?

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:42.360
Class starts in the afternoon.
Where's Toji?

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:45.030
He's on a break! Have you
got business with him?

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:49.130
Mm? Not really. I'm going to say hello!

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:55.380
Adachi-san, will you
bring out some more soda?

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:56.500
Yes, sir.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.980
Here...

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:06.990
Congratulations. Now you're
completely free of me, Toji.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:08.320
Is this all of them?

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:10.990
All of them. And I've erased everything...

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:15.330
...about Momo-chan and Jigoro
from my cell phone and my computer.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:19.670
I'm sorry. I really
messed up your life, Toji.

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:26.010
I don't know... But it's amazing
to hear you say those words, Kashiwagi.

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:27.670
What are they talking about?

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:30.740
But if I hadn't threatened to spread
that photo of the two of them

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:32.350
all over the media,

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:35.350
you'd never have split up with Momo-chan.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.750
Toji, you only started dating me

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:42.690
to make sure I couldn't do anything
to Momo-chan, right?

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:47.180
And to protect Momo-chan,
you kept on dating me...

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:52.160
Do you still love Momo-chan?

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:57.300
I have to get back to work.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:06.650
So, how's it going with you
and that brother of Okayasu's?

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:09.650
Oh, things are going fine.

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:12.990
Ryo-sama's very busy,
so I don't get to see much of him...

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:17.990
I can't think that he's going
to make you happy, Kashiwagi,

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:22.620
but since you met him,
you've changed into a really nice girl.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:34.700
I'm sorry. That's what it really was.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:40.400
"'Roto"'

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:44.350
Man, I'm beat!

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:47.690
That old fella really works a guy hard!

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:49.350
Got it!

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.700
A jigsaw puzzle?

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:59.960
Well, who'd have thought?

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:02.260
Yikes!

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:07.970
Hello?

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:11.310
Kairi? It's me.

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:14.980
Misao-chan? What is it?

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:19.320
What you said the other night
really knocked me over, Kairi.

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:23.090
You said that if you want to be loved,
you have to tell the person.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:25.660
And you were dead right.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:30.460
The truth is, I never
told Ryo-kun how I felt.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.700
Your confession to me
made me very happy, Kairi.

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:38.000
It gave me confidence.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:43.100
I have to try my luck again,
and not be afraid of the results.

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:45.570
Misao-chan...

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:02.030
You used a photo of me
and Jigoro to blackmail Toji?

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:06.700
If it had happened, Momo-chan,
you'd be scarred for life,

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:09.040
and to protect you, Toji took up with me.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.370
Get out!

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:11.700
Momo-chan...

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:15.110
I said get out! I can't bear
to look at you right now!

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:21.710
l had no idea. No idea
that all that was going on.

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:26.240
l thought l was the only one who was hurt.
l thought l was the only victim...

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:30.050
That day...

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:48.630
That day, how much did he love me,
that he would leave me like that?

00:10:54.410 --> 00:10:55.750
I wonder if I'm getting a cold...

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:56.680
Hey...

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:01.350
What's this?

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:04.690
There's an organization called the
National Soba Noodle Fans Organization.

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:08.690
Every year, they pick the best soba noodles
in the country, and award a prize.

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:11.360
Wow! C- can I eat this, then?

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:12.370
Mm-hmm.

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:13.490
Thank you!

00:11:15.030 --> 00:11:18.090
How do the best soba noodles
in Japan taste?

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:22.710
Huh?

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:24.040
How are they?

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.710
Really awful.

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:28.050
I would think so.

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:32.390
They're the cheapest noodles
I could buy at the market.

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:36.060
--Hey! You tricked me!
--I never said that
this was that soba.

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:39.790
You just jumped to the conclusion that
those were some special soba noodles.

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:47.390
Well, see you tomorrow.

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:51.070
Toji...

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:54.410
T- thank you, Toji.

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:57.970
I heard your conversation with Sae.

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:03.680
I'm sorry for all the nasty things
I did when we were breaking up.

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:09.020
I acted like a kid, when you
and I could have ridden it out.

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:11.690
Toji, it's thanks to you
that I'm here now!

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:15.360
If that photo had gotten around,
my life would've changed.

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:19.030
The fact that I can live my life
normally now is all thanks to you, Toji!

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:21.020
Truly, thank you.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.380
Fireworks?

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:34.210
That's right, tonight is the
fireworks display. Shall we go see?

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:48.730
You just jumped to the conclusion that
those were some special soba noodles.

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:53.730
I don't get it. So what if I jumped to
the conclusion that they were special?

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:55.670
Misao-chan?

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:00.400
I...

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.040
Brrr... Cold...

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.010
l can't...

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:36.070
Please hurry!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:42.720
Momo-chan...

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:43.720
Did you call me?

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:46.720
Huh? No, I didn't...

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:47.980
Oh...

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:52.730
Oh, isn't that lovely!

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:56.060
Come to think of it, last year
we watched this together...

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.400
Mm-hmm.

00:13:57.400 --> 00:14:00.070
lt was summer break
just after we started dating.

00:14:00.070 --> 00:14:02.000
Just holding his hand made my heart race.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:06.200
Rather than the fireworks, l couldn't
take my eyes off Toji's shining profile...

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:10.010
Listen...

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:13.710
If Okayasu doesn't show up on the day
you guys promised, then what will you do?

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:20.020
I don't know. I guess I'll give up on him.

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:22.020
Do you really think you can give up on him?

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:23.850
Well, what choice do I have?

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:29.390
Well, if Okayasu doesn't
show up on that day...

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:33.400
Will you genuinely try again with me?

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:53.080
I'm sorry! What? I couldn't
hear you over the fireworks...

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:56.150
No, never mind.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:04.000
l just suddenly pretended
like l couldn't hear him...

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.830
Will you genuinely try again with me?

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:20.350
He's got the beginnings of pneumonia.

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:22.680
We'll keep him here
for a while for observation.

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:25.740
Momo-chan... Momo-chan...

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:28.220
"'No new messages"'

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:31.710
I saw you!

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:38.030
You and Toji were out watching
the fireworks last night, you cheater!

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.370
Sae...

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:44.700
I thought I told you I don't
want to see your face again!

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:48.710
Momo-chan, I also thought you said that
"'Okayasu's my one and only!"'

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:50.980
I guess the bird in the hand
is better than the bird in the bush,

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:52.710
especially if he was your first love.

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:55.380
Maybe you were giving it another try?

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:56.850
No way!

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:07.990
Hurry up and get to summer school.

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:11.660
Hey! It's rude to ball me up
and then throw me aside!

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:14.670
Any word from Okayasu?

00:16:14.670 --> 00:16:16.790
You keep staring at your cell phone.

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:20.340
If you're so concerned,
Adachi, why don't you call him?

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:23.410
N- no! To put some distance between us

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:25.010
means to have no contact
with each other at all,

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:28.350
and besides, I decided that I would
wait patiently for Okayasu's answer!

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:33.350
Besides, if I call him, he'll think
I'm crowding him, and I don't want that!

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:38.020
Then relax a bit while you're waiting!
Adachi, you tend to brood over things.

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:40.360
Am I that type?

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:42.030
Oh, please!

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:44.000
Anyone who says that if I won't
listen to what she has to say,

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.360
she'll jump from the window...

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:47.130
...is a little tightly strung!

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:55.370
And then there was that time...

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:56.380
And, um...

00:16:56.380 --> 00:16:58.710
Enough! Forget about
all that ancient history!

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:01.980
No way! I'm just full of that old stuff!

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:05.320
Well, then, you say that about me,
but what about you, Toji?!

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:06.940
What about me?

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:12.320
True. So much has happened...

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:16.000
We had so many run-ins,
yet we managed to get by them.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:19.670
There was so much unhappiness,
but strangely,

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:22.670
the only times l can remember now
were the good times.

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:26.340
lt feels like we've gone
back to those times.

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:29.680
You haven't changed at all, Adachi!

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:33.870
My heart aches...Why is it
so hard to breathe!

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:39.690
After all, we didn't break up
because we hated each other.

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:43.380
What shall l do? l can't stop
this desire to go to Toji...

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:48.030
Where are you, Okayasu?

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:50.530
l said l'd wait for you, Okayasu,
but l feel like l'm being swept away,

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:52.700
and l'm frightened!

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:57.340
You see, Toji was thinking
of my welfare the whole time!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:00.640
He sacrificed himself for me...

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:04.480
Why haven't you contacted me, Okayasu?

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:07.450
l don't have any idea
what you're thinking...

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:11.980
Yo!

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.990
So! You're being released today.

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:16.450
Sir, this is a lot of fun...

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:23.000
Huh? What?! There's one piece missing!

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:25.330
Oh, yeah. I lost one piece.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.330
Ah, for Christ's sake!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:30.340
Well, one piece missing is
certainly appropriate for you!

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:34.010
You get your money stolen, you get
pneumonia in the middle of summer...

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:36.140
Boy, I really thought I was gonna die.

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:38.680
I was in real pain,
and I couldn't breathe...

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:42.680
But it helped me to see
how I feel, though.

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:44.620
When I thought it was all over,

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:48.350
I finally knew who the person
that I wanted to have with me was...

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:49.690
The girl named Momo-chan?

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.360
Hey! How did you know?!

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:52.760
How do you think?!

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:55.030
While I was carrying you,
you kept calling her name!

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:57.600
When you were teaching me
about the special noodles,

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:59.220
this is what you meant, right?

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:07.310
I had idealized Misao-chan in my head,
and caused Momo-chan all sorts of pain.

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:11.310
I wonder if we can start all over again...

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:17.320
Each person's life is like a
jigsaw puzzle with one piece missing.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:21.650
We're always looking for the person
in whom that piece is buried.

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:34.030
l'll be okay... lf l can just be strong,
l won't be swept away by other things.

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:40.670
But it's hard to wait in this
atmosphere of uncertainty.

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:44.470
Just one thing! lf l had just one thing
l could lean on to support me...

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:47.650
"'You've got mail"'

00:19:47.650 --> 00:19:48.580
"'Kairi"'

00:19:49.010 --> 00:19:50.350
Adachi?

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:54.020
It's from Okayasu! I got
a message from Okayasu!

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:56.690
Momo-chan, sorry I haven't written.

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:59.690
I'm presently working at a noodle shop.

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:01.730
I'm going to stay here,
and work for the summer,

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:04.360
and earn the money for our trip.

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:08.700
Momo-chan, I have lots
of stories I want to tell you.

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:10.570
I can't wait to see you.

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:15.870
What a simple girl l am!

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:19.500
All it takes is one word from Okayasu,
and l'm on cloud nine!

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:24.980
l'm gonna make it! With those words,

00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:27.420
l know l can wait without
any temptation to wander.

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:32.380
lt's true. l really love Okayasu.

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:35.390
Thank you.

00:20:35.390 --> 00:20:37.400
You're a good worker!

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:39.090
Thanks for everything!

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:44.070
You did good.

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:45.400
Well, see you.

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:47.410
What time are you
supposed to meet Okayasu?

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:50.310
At noon. I told him
that I'd wait five minutes,

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:52.080
and if he didn't come,
I'd give up on him, but...

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:57.080
Don't worry. I know you'll
find happiness, Adachi.

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:58.750
Thank you.

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:00.840
Well, see you when school starts.

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:06.020
Truly...

00:21:06.020 --> 00:21:12.700
l'm more grateful than words
can say. Thank you, Toji...

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:16.260
Here's your salary.
Thanks for your help this last month.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:20.040
This is too much!

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:22.370
It's a gift. Take it!

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:31.270
I'm really happy I came here. I finally
got my heart all straightened out.

00:21:33.050 --> 00:21:35.050
You've been very good to me.

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:37.060
Take care!

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.390
Hang in there, kid!

00:21:38.390 --> 00:21:39.820
Okay!

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:47.400
Yes?

00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:48.400
Aki?

00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:52.960
Yes, I'd like to see you,
if it's not too much trouble.

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:09.720
Just a little longer...

00:22:18.760 --> 00:22:20.130
"'I can't wait to see you."'

00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:27.670
Just a little longer
until l see Okayasu!

00:22:36.780 --> 00:22:43.120
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.120 --> 00:22:52.800
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:55.800
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.800 --> 00:23:02.410
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.410 --> 00:23:08.750
Where can we go

00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:18.420
where we can all be

00:23:18.420 --> 00:23:21.090
under the same sky?

00:23:21.090 --> 00:23:29.430
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.430 --> 00:23:36.110
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:36.110 --> 00:23:42.450
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.450 --> 00:23:49.790
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.790 --> 00:23:57.520
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:01.400 --> 00:24:04.400
l thought we'd be together again...

00:24:04.400 --> 00:24:10.080
Okayasu, l waited for you. l trusted
what you said, and l waited for you.

00:24:10.080 --> 00:24:13.370
Next time on Peach Girl,
"'One Stormy Night"'
